{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":10,"dc":18},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"IImWyS1BRd94S0RO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688684685033,"modifiedTime":1688684733389,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/vomit-swarm.webp","name":"Vomit Swarm (Jellyfish)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You belch forth a swarm of magical vermin. You evoke and shape the creatures from your own imagination, allowing you to change the appearance of the creatures (typically a mix of centipedes, roaches, wasps, and worms), but this doesn't change the effect of the spell. The vermin swarm over anyone in the area, their bites and stings dealing [[/r 2d8[piercing]]] damage (basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its saving throw also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. Once the spell ends, the swarm disappears.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by [[/r 1d8[piercing]]].</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"vomit-swarm","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Advanced Player's Guide","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"cone","value":30},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"formula":"2d8","type":"piercing","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"IImWyS1BRd94S0RO","heightenedLevel":2,"uses":{"value":2,"max":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688684694096,"modifiedTime":1688684713220,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.cB17yFc9456Pyfec","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"nqRZwJvefXbKYVVk"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","name":"Detect Magic","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the level of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":30},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"IImWyS1BRd94S0RO"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688684724140,"modifiedTime":1688684724140,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"P8dw7SrbaA8X259Q"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Split Skull","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The ictioctor extracts the brain of a creature that has been dead for no more than 1 minute, and absorbs the creature's knowledge. For 1 minute, the ictioctor gains a +2 circumstance bonus on attack rolls, skill checks, saving throws, and AC against the dead creature's allies.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.3wsDr1mTuxGTpydS]{Effect: Split Skull}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["manipulate"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"43RGXIJ7EvRYm0Zj","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688684743823,"modifiedTime":1688685044660,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Swarming Display","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The ictioctor detaches half of its swarm to swirl around in a distracting and threatening display. Creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:18] save, after which they are temporarily immune to further Swarming Displays for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Off-Guard]{Off-Guard} until the beginning of their next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is off-guard until the end of the ictioctor's next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature can't Step while they are off-guard.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","fear","mental","occult","visual"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"xp3fWyFzviaIwodi","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688684744215,"modifiedTime":1688684812942,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542896752,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"ZoMoJojZxbPC8mLp","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":4100000}